    {"term": "What was the Bunreacht na hÉireann (1937 Constitution) and what did it establish?", "definition": "Irish Constitution establishing the state's structure; featured Article 41 defining women's role and Articles recognising Catholic Church's special position.", "section": "hist-ire6", "type": "law"}
